== Trivia ==
*'''Goldor''' was going to be the {{mcat|b}} of [[The Catacombs - Floor VIII]] before Hypixel removed [[Maxor]], Goldor and [[Storm]] from the game and replaced them with [[Necron]].
**All three bosses were later re-added to The Catacombs - Floor VII.
*{{Item|Goldor's Armor}} and {{Item|Goldor the Fish}} are references to this boss.
* '''Goldor''' could be slowed by using a {{Item|Phantom Rod}}.
* '''Goldor''' is the only Wither Lord that never gets stunned during its fighting phase. '''Maxor''', '''Storm''' and '''Necron''' all have their respective states during which they are stunned and able to take damage. 
* '''Goldor''' is the only Wither Lord to use a normal texture of his base mob, the [[mcw:Wither|Wither]]. '''Maxor''', '''Storm''' and '''Necron''' all use the blue texture of that particular mob.

